                   ↳ Re-add the node at the current version and re-test.
  73:5    warning  HTTP Request "Notify Ops" has no timeout.  reliability/http-resilience
                   ↳ Enable Retry On Fail in Settings and set Options → Timeout.
  76:16   error    Password in URL in \`url\` of "Notify Ops" (Pa55…4! (14 chars)).  security/hardcoded-secret
                   ↳ Rotate it, then move it into an n8n credential and reference that instead.
  97:15   info     "Telegram" still has its default name.  hygiene/default-node-name
                   ↳ Name it after what it does.
  105:24  error    "Telegram" carries credential data inline (telegramApi: accessToken). Exports should only reference credentials by id and name.  security/embedded-credentials
                   ↳ Remove the inline fields and reference a stored n8n credential.
  130:15  error    Node name "Format Reply" is used more than once.  reliability/duplicate-node-name
                   ↳ Give every node a unique name.
  150:19  warning  "Debug Logger" is disabled.  reliability/disabled-node
                   ↳ Remove it or enable it. If it is intentionally optional, say so in its notes and disable this rule there.
