                   ↳ Connect it or delete it.
  178:19  warning  Code node "Clean CSV" is 194 lines / 13140 chars (limit 150 lines / 8000 chars).  reliability/large-code-node
                   ↳ Split it or move the logic into a sub-workflow.
  275:15  warning  No error workflow set, and 4 node(s) that call external services have no error handling: "HTTP Request1", "Notify Ops", "Telegram", "Old Sheets Export".  reliability/unhandled-errors
